~ intro
do play("disposable_worker_close")
do play("ACT1")
do wait(3)
do wait(2)
disposable_worker: Finally
disposable_worker: Management gave us of a new robot employee
disposable_worker: A vending machine [#anim=grin]
disposable_worker: Moments like these are exactly why I tolerate my job
do play_and_wait("disposable_worker_close_to_idle")
do play("disposable_worker_idle")
disposable_worker: I will have...
disposable_worker: [color=#1bffc2]One large coffee[/color].
disposable_worker: Inside, there will be five shots of espresso
disposable_worker: Low acidity, caramel drizzle
disposable_worker: Extra foam
disposable_worker: Four melted ice cubes
disposable_worker: Blessed by a sacred animal
disposable_worker: Sugar free caramel
disposable_worker: Quadruple blended
disposable_worker: With extra cream and cinnamon on the side
disposable_worker: Coffee is a sacred ritual for me
disposable_worker: Be exact, my mental health depends on this
do play("drag_items_tutorial")
=> END!

~ first_large_coffee
do wait(1)
disposable_worker: Ouch
disposable_worker: Listen buddy
disposable_worker: This is just plain black coffee without any of the stuff I said
disposable_worker: Back in my day, robots just did things
disposable_worker: People used to be able to press a button
disposable_worker: and if that didn't work, then just kick the thing
disposable_worker: Now you are all so smart
disposable_worker: Just the other day
disposable_worker: They threw out one robot for [color=#ff851b][wave amp=25 freq=5]emotional malfunctions[/wave][/color] last week
disposable_worker: You can have this back, it tastes like disappointment
do play("disposable_worker", "throw")
do play_and_wait("coffeeCup")
do play("disposable_worker", "grin")
automat: [color=#1bffc2]H-hey, wait this isnt fair![/color]
do play("moral_compass_unlocked")
do wait(3)
do play_and_wait("compass_gain")
do play("Lock1")
do next_encounter()
=> END!

~ first_medium
disposable_worker: This is a medium
disposable_worker: I am not even taking a sip
disposable_worker: I am alergic to medium things
disposable_worker: Because of my high standards
=> END!

